# Intro to AI: Getting Started

This module focused on understanding the foundations of Artificial Intelligence, its evolution, and how AI relates to fields like Machine Learning, Deep Learning, and Data Science.

Throughout this section, I explored the differences between natural and artificial intelligence, learned about the history and milestones of AI, and understood the various types of AI systems being developed today.

